00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:37.733
The snapper.

00:00:37.733 --> 00:00:38.566
(snaps fingers)

00:00:38.566 --> 00:00:41.250
- If you click at me, wherever you were

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.676
on my priority list, you
just went to the bottom.

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:46.750
- Yeah, you've now just dropped
to literally last place.

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:48.720
It's so rude.

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:50.620
Don't snap at somebody.

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:52.010
I'm not your servant.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.717
- It just ruins the whole experience.

00:00:53.717 --> 00:00:55.490
- "Yeah, I'll get your Diet Coke."

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:57.521
- Or they wave you down like a dog.

00:00:57.521 --> 00:00:58.400
- Over here.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:00:59.233
- Over here.

00:00:59.233 --> 00:01:00.470
