complains about how, like,

00:02:00.457 --> 00:02:02.820
"The server always comes
up when my mouth is full!"

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:04.438
We're doing it on purpose.

00:02:04.438 --> 00:02:07.130
I want to say like,
eight times out of ten,

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:09.060
we're doing it on purpose
so that we can just

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:12.370
get the head nod that
everything's okay, and then run.

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:14.770
- I'm all about families going
out and enjoying their time

00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:17.100
together, but if your
kid is a (bleep) maniac

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:19.920
