my family's super hungry."

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.732
And I was like, "I'm gonna
keep this 'cause I work

00:02:55.732 --> 00:02:58.540
"a minimum-wage job, but the
wait is not going to change."

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:02.160
- I've had people just
literally screaming at me.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.707
I've been called a bitch over eggs,

00:03:03.707 --> 00:03:05.357
and I just looked at her and went,

00:03:05.357 --> 00:03:06.906
"I'm gonna go grab my manager."

00:03:06.906 --> 00:03:09.887
