00:03:11.077 --> 00:03:12.077
"I don't need to take this from you."

00:03:12.077 --> 00:03:14.105
- We have a really big
menu at my restaurant.

00:03:14.105 --> 00:03:15.882
They don't even open
it, they just sit there

00:03:15.882 --> 00:03:18.680
and it's like, "What's good here?"

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:20.177
It's like, "Well we have a lot of stuff,

00:03:20.177 --> 00:03:21.760
