00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:36.403
"No, guys, it's in front of you."

00:03:36.403 --> 00:03:37.603
Sometimes we're busy and I'm like,

00:03:37.603 --> 00:03:39.180
"You can read it, I'll be right back."

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:40.110
- Just open the menu.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.380
Please, please God.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:43.030
