00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:48.119
- Have you ever been grabbed,
like has anyone ever?

00:03:48.119 --> 00:03:48.985
- Mm-hmm.

00:03:48.985 --> 00:03:50.340
- Oh, I hate that too.

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:53.366
- When you drop stuff at
the table, and they ask you

00:03:53.366 --> 00:03:55.410
for something else, and
you go back to get it,

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.629
