00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:15.040
There's a wait for a certain section.

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:16.487
If it's nice out, they
want to sit outside.

00:04:16.487 --> 00:04:18.023
"There's a wait outside, but if you want,

00:04:18.023 --> 00:04:19.880
