00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:23.667
And his friends were
like, "What's going on?

00:05:23.667 --> 00:05:24.500
"What's going on?"

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.900
And I was like, "Uh, this
is what he just said to me."

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:28.130
And he had like a couple of
girlfriends in the group,

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:30.833
