00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:07.837
not giving them all your
attention, flirting back.

00:06:07.837 --> 00:06:08.723
- (Bleep), you're lucky.

00:06:08.723 --> 00:06:10.410
I don't get hit on.

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:12.591
- No, I wouldn't call that lucky. (laughs)

00:06:12.591 --> 00:06:15.920
- When they go out to eat,
they order everything.

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:17.974
They'll get two appetizers,
they'll get the most expensive

00:06:17.974 --> 00:06:19.890
