afford to spend all that,

00:06:27.655 --> 00:06:29.630
you have to factor in a tip.

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:31.528
This is, I feel, like,
the number one pet peeve.

00:06:31.528 --> 00:06:32.480
It's a given.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:37.043
But don't go spending
$300 if you can't tip.

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:40.590
- Bad tippers, people who tip terribly

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:41.549
after they put you through the moves.

00:06:41.549 --> 00:06:43.950
- Or when they leave a verbal tip.

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:45.300
We like to call it verbal tips.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.760
Where they, like, pat you on the shoulder

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:49.100
and they're like, "You did a great job."

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.610
