00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.215
it's like you should triple that at least.

00:07:16.215 --> 00:07:17.270
- Exactly.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:18.103
You have to.

00:07:18.103 --> 00:07:19.160
Because you're taking away from...

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.618
- You're taking away from other tables.

00:07:20.618 --> 00:07:21.537
- Exactly.

00:07:21.537 --> 00:07:22.370
- And money that we could get.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.171
- In all the bad years
that I've experienced

00:07:24.171 --> 00:07:26.820
in the restaurant business,
I've also met a lot of

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:29.320
incredible people as well.

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.153
