friends through working

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:47.337
in the service industry, because
you have to have a backbone

00:07:47.337 --> 00:07:48.800
to be able to do it.

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:50.890
- Oh my God, do you
have to have a backbone.

