- I'm more worried about you
if you treat me with respect.

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:55.490
I'm not your slave, I work there

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:57.460
for minimum wage plus tips.

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:58.400
